<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Roadcorp plans rights issue.</title>
<headline>Roadcorp plans rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roadcorp Ltd said on Friday it planned a rights issue for an unspecified amount to raise additional capital to reduce debt and finance future growth.</p>
<p>A further announcement on terms will be made around November 11. Register date is November 15.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
